Looking at this problem, I need to find all linear continuous maps $T: (C^\infty([-1,1]), \|\cdot\|_\infty) \to (C^\infty([-1,1]), \|\cdot\|_\infty)$ satisfying $TD = DT$, where $D = d/dx$.

**Answer check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions or proof sketches. Proceeding.

